|O-8|Research use of own-word lists: anonymisation; re-identification risk in a small home with a local dialect; ethics review.|EM-02 language notes; VT-05|Group
|O-9|Pepper at the door: a private spot for consent questions, out of the walking path. Check on site.|TECH-01; RP-01|Group

